WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:25.120
(indistinct chatter)

00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:45.040
(indistinct chatter)

00:02:06.120 --> 00:02:08.920
 MAN (over radio):
 They refuse to recognize
 the existence of the Rohingya.

00:02:08.920 --> 00:02:11.040
 REPORTER (over radio):
 They are in hatred of Muslims.

00:02:11.040 --> 00:02:13.680
 REPORTER 2 (over radio):
 The Rohingya villages have
 burned in recent weeks.

00:02:13.680 --> 00:02:16.280
 REPORTER 3 (over radio):
 What can only be described
 as a premeditated massacre.

00:02:16.520 --> 00:02:18.920
 REPORTER 4 (over radio):
 The UN says it looks
 like a textbook example

00:02:18.920 --> 00:02:20.920
 of ethnic cleansing.

00:02:24.880 --> 00:02:27.360
(screams)

00:02:34.960 --> 00:02:36.880
 REPORTER 5 (over radio):
 Urged to flee for their lives.

00:02:36.880 --> 00:02:39.440
 REPORTER 6 (over TV):
 The world's fastest growing
 humanitarian crisis.

00:02:39.440 --> 00:02:41.200
 REPORTER 7 (over radio):
 Over half a million
 Rohingya Muslims have now

00:02:41.200 --> 00:02:43.800
 fled across
 the border into Bangladesh.

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:46.480
 REPORTER 8 (over TV):
 The new arrivals could end up

00:02:46.480 --> 00:02:49.000
 in the biggest
 refugee camp on earth.

00:04:41.600 --> 00:04:43.040
KAMAL: Dokana?

00:17:02.840 --> 00:17:04.080
JABER: Jaber Hussain.

00:19:44.240 --> 00:19:50.480
♪ ♪

00:21:38.480 --> 00:21:40.080
Captioned by Cotter
Captioning Services.

